{"ticker":"PCG","updated":"2026-10-23T23:26:41Z","profile":{"longName":"PG&E Corporation","shortName":"Pacific Gas & Electric Co.","sector":"Utilities","industry":"Utilities - Regulated Electric","country":"United States","website":"https://www.pgecorp.com","fullTimeEmployees":29010,"marketCap":37919895552,"trailingPE":9.355556,"forwardPE":7.0117583,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":1.4676585,"pegRatio":0.54,"targetMeanPrice":17.55882,"targetHighPrice":24.0,"targetLowPrice":14.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":17,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.001,"earningsGrowth":0.398,"grossMargins":0.39823002,"operatingMargins":0.24788,"profitMargins":0.11828,"totalRevenue":25837000704,"beta":0.279,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":19.16,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":11.77,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.54},"summary":"PG&E Corporation, through its subsidiary, Pacific Gas and Electric Company, engages in the sale and delivery of electricity and natural gas to customers in northern and central California, the United States. It generates electricity using nuclear, hydroelectric, fossil fuel-fired, fuel cells, and photovoltaic sources. The company owns and operates interconnected transmission lines; electric transmission substations, distribution lines, switching and distribution substations; and natural gas transmission, storage, and distribution systems consisting of distribution pipelines, backbone and local transmission pipelines, and various storage facilities. It serves residential, commercial, industrial, and agricultural customers, as well as natural gas-fired electric generation facilities. The company was incorporated in 1995 and is based in Oakland, California.","summary_zh":"PG&E Corporation 透過其子公司 Pacific Gas and Electric Company 向美國加州北部和中部的客戶銷售和輸送電力和天然氣。它利用核能、水力發電、化石燃料發電、燃料電池和光伏資源發電。該公司擁有並經營互連輸電線路；輸變電站、配電線路、開關和配電變電站；天然氣輸送、儲存和分配系統，由分配管道、骨幹和地方輸送管道以及各種儲存設施組成。它為住宅、商業、工業和農業客戶以及天然氣發電設施提供服務。該公司成立於 1995 年，總部位於加州奧克蘭。","sector_zh":"公用事業","industry_zh":"公用事業 - 受